/*******************************************************************************

This file has been generated by SoftKernelGenerator and controls what
TintModes, BlendModes and PixelFormats are supported in software rendering as
well as what blit operations have custom/optimized implementations.

The more supported, the more code is generated, resulting in a larger binary.

Generating optimized blits for all possible combinations can result in tens of
thousands of optimized render loops, growing the size of WonderGUI by many
megabytes.

For modern desktop applications wg_softkernels_default.h/cpp provides a good
balance between size and performance, supporting everyting but only optimizing
most important blit operations.

********************************************************************************

SUPPORTED MODES AND FORMATS 

Tint modes:            None
                       Flat
                       GradientX
                       (GradientY and GradientXY removed, not used since Tints replaced Tintmaps)

Blend modes:           Replace
                       Blend
                       Add
                       BlendFixedColor

Source formats:        XRGB_8_sRGB
                       ARGB_8_sRGB
                       Index_8_sRGB
                       Alpha_8
                       RGB_565_sRGB
                       (unsupported: XRGB_8_linear ARGB_8_linear Index_8_linear Index_16_sRGB Index_16_linear RGB_565_linear BGR_565_BE_linear)

Destination formats:   XRGB_8_sRGB
                       ARGB_8_sRGB
                       RGB_565_sRGB
                       (unsupported: XRGB_8_linear ARGB_8_linear Index_16_sRGB Index_16_linear Alpha_8 RGB_565_linear BGR_565_BE_linear)


CUSTOM BLIT KERNELS DEFINITION #1

Operations:         StraightBlit
                    TransformBlitNearest
                    TransformClipBlitNearest
                    TransformBlitBilinear
                    TransformClipBlitBilinear
                    
Tint Modes:         None
                    
Blend Modes:        Replace
                    Blend
                    BlendFixedColor
                    
Source Formats:     XRGB_8_sRGB
                    ARGB_8_sRGB
                    Index_8_sRGB
                    Alpha_8
                    RGB_565_sRGB
                    
Destination Formats:XRGB_8_sRGB
                    ARGB_8_sRGB
                    RGB_565_sRGB
                    

CUSTOM BLIT KERNELS DEFINITION #1

Operations:         StraightBlit
                    
Tint Modes:         None
                    Flat
                    
Blend Modes:        Add
                    
Source Formats:     XRGB_8_sRGB
                    ARGB_8_sRGB
                    Index_8_sRGB
                    Alpha_8
                    RGB_565_sRGB
                    
Destination Formats:XRGB_8_sRGB
                    ARGB_8_sRGB
                    RGB_565_sRGB
                    

*******************************************************************************/

